{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 18, :comments ["<b>Or with any hand-tool of wood.</b> Since it says (there) ״וְכִי יַכֶּה אִישׁ אֶת עַבְדּוֹ אוֹ אֶת אֲמָתוֹ בַּשֵּׁבֶט״ — I might say any staff whatsoever; therefore it says ״בְּעֵץ אֲשֶׁר יָמוּת בּוֹ״ — that it must have enough to kill with (Sifrei)."], :book :numbers, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 35, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T09:13:51.519600814Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}